  "mermaidCode": "sequenceDiagram\n  autonumber\n  actor p0 as 用户\n  participant p1 as 支付宝平台\n  participant p2 as 商户系统\n  p0->>p1: 发起取消 订单\n  p1->>p2: 预取消咨询spi.alipay.commerce.logistics.carshipping.cancel.consult\n  Note over p2: 判断是否可取消 计算取消 费⽤\n  p2-->>p1: 返回取消咨询结果 cancel _ fee, is free _ _ cancel\n  p1-->>p0: 展示取消结果及费⽤\n  p0->>p1: 确认取消\n  p1->>p2: 订单取消 请求(spi.alipay.commerce.logistics.carshipping.order.cancel含 cancel reason id\n  Note over p2: 执⾏取消 核算最终费⽤\n  p2-->>p1: 返回取消结果(cancel _ fee, pay_ cancel _ fee, cancel _ status)\n  p1->>p0: 推 送：取消成功 如有退款告知退款⾦额\n  Note over p1: 状态同步：CS_CANCEL\n  p1->>p0: 订单已取消\n"
